 SBT-DF203 Lab 3: SYN Flood Investigation Using TShark

This repository contains the forensic evidence, analysis scripts, packet capture (`.pcapng`) files, TSV field extractions, and terminal documentation for **SBT-DF203 Lab 3**. 

The investigation evaluates the differences between normal, full 3-way TCP HTTP handshakes and a bounded SYN Flood attack pattern (half-open connection attempts) executed via a Scapy probe script on a Linux loopback interface (`lo`).


